CM_ "Tailored to the Aolithium battery CAN frames observed with candump on 2026-09-24. Known Pylontech-compatible signals are decoded; additional observed frames are preserved as raw values until their signal definitions are verified.";
CM_ BO_ 858 "Observed as CAN 0x35A, 8 bytes. Protocol-family sources identify 0x35A as alarms/warnings, but bit definitions were not assumed here.";
CM_ BO_ 862 "Observed payload 50 59 4C 4F 4E, ASCII 'PYLON'. Battery sends 5 bytes, unlike older Pylontech DBCs that expect 8 bytes.";
CM_ BO_ 884 "Observed payload decodes as ASCII 'LOWEST74'. Stored raw until semantics are verified.";
CM_ BO_ 885 "Observed payload decodes as ASCII 'HIGHEST '. Stored raw until semantics are verified.";
CM_ BO_ 886 "Observed payload decodes as ASCII 'MIN_CELL'. Stored raw until semantics are verified.";
CM_ BO_ 887 "Observed payload decodes as ASCII 'MAX_CELL'. Stored raw until semantics are verified.";
